@40031 = ~receives a -2 penalty to THAC0, damage rolls, and Saving Throws unless the target makes a Saving Throw vs. Spell (with an additional -1 penalty at 3rd, 5th, 7th, and 9th level, up to -4)~
@40032 = ~Faerie Fire~
@40033 = ~Faerie Fire
(Evocation)

Level: 1
Sphere: Combat, Weather
Range: 40 ft.
Duration: 4 rounds
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: 5-ft. radius
Saving Throw: Neg.

This spell outlines enemies in the area of effect with a pale violet glow. Outlined creatures suffer a -2 penalty to Armor Class and cannot become invisible for 4 rounds unless they make a Saving Throw vs. Spell.~
@40034 = ~Duration: 1 turn \+ 1 round/level~
@40035 = ~Duration: 1 turn/level~
@40036 = ~Web, Hold Person, Grease, and Entangle\.~
@40037 = ~Web, Hold Person, Grease, Entangle, Slow, and Stun.~
@40038 = ~Mass Regenerate~
@40039 = ~Mass Regenerate
(Alteration)

Level: 5
Sphere: Healing
Range: 0
Duration: 1 turn + 2 rounds/level
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: Sight
Saving Throw: None

When cast, this spell grants the druid and all party members within sight steady regeneration of 2 Hit Points per round (1 Hit Point every 3 seconds) for 1 turn plus 2 rounds per level of the caster (up to 30 rounds at 10th level). Multiple castings do not stack.~
@40040 = ~Duration: Instant~
@40041 = ~eliminates all toxins, and also heals 10 Hit Points of damage\. Moreover, any diseases, blindness, or deafness that the creature may be suffering from will also be cured\.~
